cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cheltenham Open Data in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cheltenham Open Data"
abstract: >-
  Cheltenham Open Data gathers official local data about Cheltenham and
  Gloucestershire into one free website, including house prices, rents,
  fuel prices, flood and weather warnings, power cuts, schools, health
  services and Cheltenham Town FC history. This repository holds the site
  and the scripts that fetch, check and update its data from official
  sources such as the ONS, HM Land Registry and the Met Office.
authors:
  - given-names: Mat
    family-names: Benfield
    alias: thechelsuk
    website: "https://thechels.uk"
url: "https://cheltenham-od.uk"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thechelsuk/uk.cheltenham-od"
license: MIT
keywords:
